//  ###     UNREACHABLE.                                                    ###
//  ###   * fAllMotorHome IS NEVER SET TRUE HERE, SO NOTHING IN THIS TREE   ###
//  ###     CAN LEAVE THE not-homed STATE VIA THIS PATH.  Note this is NOT  ###
